      "type": "Formula re: Contains",
      "notes": "The Gaspari Difference\nEnteric coating increases bioavailability and limits gastric distress\nHighest concentration of DHA and EPA (70%) from 2,400 mg of fish oil\n960 mg EPA and 720 mg DHA per serving"
